title: "Predator-Swarm-Guide (PSG) crowd model: code and videos"
abstract: "MATLAB code and videos for the ACC 2024 paper on the Predator-Swarm-Guide model of crowd motion during an active-shooter event: evacuation simulations with baseline and optimized parameters, and crowd equilibria predicted by the continuum-limit analysis."
